  "problem": "What is missing from the statement below?\n\n$$\n8\\times \\frac{3}{2}=\\bbox[2pt,border:1pt solid black]{\\phantom{A}}÷\\bbox[2pt,border:1pt solid black]{\\phantom{A}}\\times 3\n$$",
